Listen to "867-5309 / Jenny" by Tommy Tutone, and sing along with the simple HD lyrics on screen! 

Something to note! I was debating on weather to put it in as... 
-"eight, six, seven, five, three oh nine". Like it said in the lyrics online 
- "8 6 7 5 3 0 9" 
or the way I ended up doing it 
- "867-5309" 
That's the way the number would be written down anyways so that's why I chose to do it this way. I was going to originally keep what the lyrics said online but it just felt weird. So I wrote it like I did instead. If you don't like it then make your own I guess. 

